I agree that shops are too hard to rob.  Actually, all I do with shopkeepers
now is kill them for their cash as soon as I get strong enough.  Once upon a
time, they had unlimited money, so you wanted to keep them alive to sell them
gems.  Now that they run out of money, there's no point in keeping them alive.
You get just as much money for killing them as you could by collecting stuff
and selling it.  I have never robbed a shop in 3.1.1 except to piss shopkeepers
off and get some Kop corpses.

I noticed in my current game that my god doesn't seem to get angry when my elf
kills shopkeepers.  Is there a reason for this?  When I check it out in
wizard mode, he always gets mad...  Of course, Kop corpses are great for
sacrificing...

